@page "/markets/access-control"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Access control electronics manufacturing";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Hana manufactures access control electronics — RFID access cards, smart lock and door hardware assembly — RFID depth and box build under one company.";
    ViewData["Canonical"] = "https://www.hanagroup.com/markets/access-control";
}
@section Head {
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/market-page.css" />
}

<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Access Control</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><span class="hero-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span><h1 class="mk-h1">Access control electronics manufacturing</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana is a market leading manufacturer of access control and RFID credentials and the electronic hardware they work with, from cards, fobs and inlays through to readers, locks and related access-control products.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="/images/photos/mk-access-control-hero.webp" alt="Smart card and access control device assembly" /></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>Smart door locks</span><span>Access readers</span><span>Key cards &amp; fobs</span><span>Fingerprint locks</span><span>Hotel safes</span><span>Security tokens</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark" data-hana-geo="side" data-geo-theme="blue"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Flexible to turnkey access control manufacturing within one group</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">For over 20 years, Hana has manufactured access control hardware for some of the leading brands in the market, a testament to the standards and long relationship we pride ourselves in. Our access control programs have a depth of market understanding unique in our field show cased by:</p></div><div class="mk-points mk-points--rows"><div class="pt"><div class="t">A flexible manufacturing partner:</div><p>specialised in high volume low mix, low volume high mix and modular production lines to cope with fluctuating demand</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-country manufacturing</div><p>Access-control manufacturing across China and Cambodia provides additional capacity and the option to qualify production at more than one Hana location.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Extensive access control &amp; test experience</div><p>More than 20 years of manufacturing locks, pads, cards, tags and inlays across LF, HF and UHF, supported by automated inlay production. In-house functional and RF test covers wireless protocols including NFC, Bluetooth and Wi-Fi, verified against customer and industry standards.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">More than a manufacturing partner - Design with Hana</div><p>Our customers achieve faster time to market with upfront DFM and NPI collaborations and express prototyping alongside our extensive in-house PCB, tooling and packaging engineering services.</p><div class="mk-pt-links"><a href="/capabilities/dfx-jdm">DFx and JDM collaboration <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c2"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/access-control/rfid-cards"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-access-control-card-rfid-cards.webp" alt="RFID access card and reader"></div><div class="body"><div class="t">RFID Access Cards</div><p>Contactless cards, fobs and credentials across LF, HF and UHF, manufactured using automated inlay processes with encoding and personalization available to program requirements.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/access-control/smart-lock-assembly"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-access-control-card-smart-lock.webp" alt="Assembled access-control reader on the line" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Smart Lock &amp; Door Hardware</div><p>Box build of readers, keypads, fingerprint and BLE locks, safes and key deposits, including final product assembly and functional test.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where it&#39;s made</h2><p class="mk-body">Access-control manufacturing is supported by Hana sites in China and Cambodia, with additional RFID credential manufacturing in the USA. Programs can be qualified across more than one Hana location where additional capacity or supply continuity is required. See <a href="/locations">Locations</a> for plant-level detail.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/koh-kong"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Cambodia</span></span><div class="nm">Koh Kong</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ohio"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">USA</span></span><div class="nm">Ohio</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from access-control engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for access control?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures RFID access cards, fobs and other credentials, together with reader and lock hardware including keypads, fingerprint and BLE locks, safes and key deposits. Programs can therefore source both credentials and associated electronic hardware within the Hana group.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana make both the card and the lock?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana has manufactured RFID credentials for more than 20 years and also provides box build for the readers, locks and associated hardware used with them. This allows credential and hardware production to be coordinated within one manufacturing group.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites serve access-control programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Access-control programs are supported by Jiaxing in China and Koh Kong in Cambodia, with additional RFID credential manufacturing in China and the USA.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Does Hana handle miniature and micro assemblies?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Access-control products frequently use compact PCBAs, sensor assemblies and other miniature electronic components. Hana supports these requirements through its broader microelectronics and electronics-assembly capabilities.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start an access-control build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us about your product, manufacturing requirements and expected volumes. We can identify the appropriate Hana site and process route for your program.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>

